      "title": {
        "en": "Welcoming and supportive clinic team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "The overwhelming majority of pet owners praise Dr. Blake, Dr. Thordarson, and the nursing staff for their thoroughness, empathy, and welcoming demeanor. Clients note that veterinarians take ample time during appointments without rushing examinations. While one reviewer experienced a frustrating front-desk scheduling dispute, clients consistently express deep gratitude for the caring support shown to their families."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling of dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently note how gently and patiently the veterinary team handles both cats and dogs during exams and routine procedures. Multiple reviewers mention that nervous or frightened pets were quickly comforted by the compassionate staff. Pet owners also appreciate the sensitive and empathetic care provided during difficult senior pet stages."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 7,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations of medical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents appreciate that doctors explain diagnoses, treatment alternatives, and clinical recommendations with great patience and transparency. Reviewers emphasize that the veterinarians readily answer questions and make sure owners feel fully informed. Aside from a single communication dispute at reception, clients value the clear and honest dialogue regarding their pets."
      }
    }
  ],
